WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.850
Step 1. Find the file. Here you save a copy of a file from Care on your device.

1.2
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:11.312
Open the Files tab of the patient or the encounter, and find the file.

2.1
00:00:11.312 --> 00:00:16.966
Step 2. Open the actions menu. Select More Actions in the row of the file.

2.2
00:00:16.966 --> 00:00:20.534
It is the button with three vertical dots.

3.1
00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:26.341
Step 3. Select Download. Care shows Downloading file when the download starts.

3.2
00:00:26.341 --> 00:00:32.043
It then saves the file on your device, and shows File download completed.
